{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>TimeTill 是一款專為追蹤重要時刻而設計的倒數計時應用程式，無論是假期、節日、截止日期還是個人目標，都能輕鬆管理。目前這款應用正在進行終生版限時免費活動，原價 US $29.99 的完整功能現在可以免費領取。</p>\n\n<h2>功能特色簡介</h2>\n<p>TimeTill 支援建立無限量的倒數計時，用戶可透過照片、顏色與個人細節進行自訂，並擁有超過 50 種字體和主題。同時提供主畫面及鎖定畫面小工具，多種尺寸讓重要資訊一目了然。此外，智能追蹤功能包括正計時與倒數計時，並可與日曆同步，自動提醒用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-63-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-64-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-65-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-66-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-67-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2064x2752bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>TimeTill: Countdown &amp; Widgets 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4101\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_4101-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4102\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_4102-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：TimeTill: Countdown &amp; Widgets</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-18T23:25:27.680811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":427,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}